# Delete Button — a gooey Skia button (blur + alpha-threshold layer): tapping
# red "Delete" slides it left, turns it black "Confirm", and a round X button
# oozes out to its right; tapping Confirm fires onConfirmDeletion (button stays
# in confirm state), tapping X merges back to "Delete".
# What this test covers: delete -> X -> delete cycles with springs settled,
# Confirm taps, reversing mid-spring (X right after Delete, Delete right after
# X), a rapid burst on Delete/Confirm, a touch that starts on the button and
# drags off (no tap; press scale must recover), taps outside the shapes, and a
# press-and-hold. Canvas 230x50 centred: Delete x~201, Confirm x~161, X x~276, y 437.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/delete-button"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 30000
wait 1000
press 201 437
wait 1000
press 161 437
wait 800
press 276 437
wait 1000
# Reverse mid-spring both ways.
press 201 437
wait 150
press 276 437
wait 1000
press 201 437
wait 1000
press 276 437
wait 150
press 201 437
wait 1000
# Confirm twice more, then close.
press 161 437
wait 400
press 161 437
wait 400
press 276 437
wait 1000
# Rapid burst on the button (Delete -> Confirm -> Confirm ...).
press 190 437 --count 6 --interval-ms 90
wait 1200
press 276 437
wait 1000
# Touch that starts on the button and drags off: no tap fires.
gesture pan 201 437 0 -150 600
wait 1000
gesture pan 201 437 150 0 600
wait 1000
# Taps outside the shapes but inside the canvas.
press 95 420
wait 400
# Hold then release.
longpress 201 437 800
wait 1000
press 276 437
wait 1000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
